  "releaseNotes": "- Url and Protocol validated; Protocol defaults to https\n- Listings use the blob hierarchy; reads, listings and deletes no longer create the container\n- Directory deletes run page by page; deleting the root is refused\n- Download links are read-only, valid for at most 7 days, https-only on https endpoints\n- Move uses a renewed 60 s lease and a 10 minute copy timeout\n- Requires Cloud.File.Storage.Manager.Common 3.1.0",
